# Reference: the first over as a stream. * lets Redis choose each id, MAXLEN ~ 1000 caps the log cheaply.
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 1 batter p-028 runs 4
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 2 batter p-028 runs 1
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 3 batter p-034 runs 0
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 4 batter p-034 runs 6
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 5 batter p-028 runs 2
XADD match:m-041:balls MAXLEN ~ 1000 * over 1 ball 6 batter p-028 runs 1
XLEN match:m-041:balls
XRANGE match:m-041:balls - + COUNT 2
XINFO STREAM match:m-041:balls
